{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式／最後一場幻彩詠香江晚上八時上演\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261118.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日(11月18日)將出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式，以及為與會代表舉行的歡迎宴會。另外，最後一場幻彩詠香江今晚八時上演，香港冬日小鎮中環及尖沙咀亦啟動。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:22:33.711362+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:43:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:19.365434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:09.208714+00:00","content_hash":"8e3c3302da78d1f50ae59eec3448e638b15e23ca39d93effddcb60720c66f3cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:22:33.711362+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}